        text = "5. [Quests]\nHere you can view the current business status and claim Revenue Quest Rewards.\nDaily Quests are reset at midnight every day, and they can also be reset manually with Diamonds up to 6 times.\nCrafting Quests provide an unlimited amount of Recipe Materials. You need to use them to complete research on specific recipes within the given time. If you run out of time or close the UI, you will fail the quest, and you will only get 5 Adventure Coins; But if you succeed, you will get 7 Adventure Coins.",
